# Root .dockerignore - applies to every image whose build CONTEXT is the repo
# root (apps/web, apps/backend, apps/realtime-sse per their Coolify config and
# the compose `context: ..` entries).
#
# Added 2026-10-01 (eng review F9). Before this file, a root-context build sent
# node_modules/, every .next/, and the real .env into the builder - slow, and one
# stray COPY of . would have baked secrets into an image. apps/web/.dockerignore
# exists but does NOT apply: Docker only reads a .dockerignore at the CONTEXT
# root, and the context here is the repo root, not apps/web/.
#
# Keep the "!keep" exceptions narrow - they must list anything a Dockerfile COPYs
# on purpose.

# Dependencies (pnpm install runs inside the image)
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store

# Build outputs
**/.next
**/dist
**/out
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Environment files - never bake secrets into an image
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Version control + editor + CI
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.cursor
.husky

# Test + coverage artifacts
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.pytest_cache

# Docs + license (not needed to build; keeps the context small)
*.md
LICENSE

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Windows/WSL mounts, if the repo is ever built from one
/mnt
